    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66679" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταιτ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>demand one's share of</i>, c. gen. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς βασιληΐης μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.146
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.150
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέρος τινὸς μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					972
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. παρά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.222
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nec.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>beg of, ask alms of</i>, c. acc. pers., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				775
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>beg, solicit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐφήμερον τροφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
